#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.death.page.01"
msgstr "He fell here. The page neither forgives nor forgets."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.death.page.02"
msgstr "The road goes on; the one who fell does not remember it."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.death.page.03"
msgstr "A line written in dust and in shame."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.death.page.04"
msgstr "They died believing what was not. The book saw it."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.death.page.05"
msgstr "They rose again, but the page keeps them."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.death.page.06"
msgstr "It was not the end. It was a fault in the manuscript."

